  "response": {
    "text": "1. Confirm work permit `FUSE-7319` is approved.\n2. Confirm inactive spectrometer `QW-71F` is disconnected from acquisition.\n3. Confirm the Calder Fuse Station displays **Interlock Closed**.\n4. Do not alter active spectrometer `QW-88K`.\n5. Run:\n   ```bash\n   calderctl wafer inspect QW-71F --bank ember-6\n   ```\n6. Continue only if the command returns:\n   ```text\n   leases=0 floor=v11.2 target=v12.6\n   ```\n\n> **WARNING:** The next command permanently seals the firmware floor at `v12.6`. After sealing, the spectrometer can never load firmware below `v12.6`, and a factory reset cannot lower the floor.\n\n7. Seal the firmware floor:\n   ```bash\n   calderctl wafer seal QW-71F --bank ember-6 --floor v12.6 --permit FUSE-7319\n   ```\n8. Run:\n   ```bash\n   calderctl wafer attest QW-71F --bank ember-6\n   ```\n9. Confirm the command returns:\n   ```text\n   floor=v12.6 fuse=sealed\n   ```",
